option:file:conf-cap-link-local-nexthop.conf
option:open:inspect-open-message
# Re-recorded when the OPEN stopped giving every capability a parameter of its own.
# RFC 5492 4: "The Capabilities Optional Parameter (OPEN Optional Parameter Type 2)
# SHOULD only be included in the OPEN message once."  The capability TLVs below are the
# same TLVs in the same order as before, carried by one type 2 parameter instead of one
# each, so the message is shorter by two octets per capability and says the same thing.
1:raw:FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF:002F:01:04FFFD00B40A00000212021001040002000141040000FFFD06004D00
